#! console --size 120x34 --config '{"console":{"titleIntro":true,"titleWeights":{"kali":1}}}'
# A cold console start with the Kali fold pinned: the fold opens from a deep zoom, then the
# name rises through it. The clock is frozen, so each snap is the frame at that second.
wait-frame 15000 command palette
tick 100
snap start
tick 900
snap opening
tick 1500
snap name-rising
tick 2500
snap settled
quit
